--                  each USDA household measure classified by the resolver's own classifyMeasure (portionText.ts), one row per
--                  (fdc_id, unit, size). 5207 FNDDS "Quantity not specified" weights are serving rows marked is_default (no region).
--                  22313 rows are on 055's foods (a duplicate description's measures moved onto the kept row's fdc_id);
--                  162 are NEW measures for live verified rows (founder decision j14: listed for sign-off in the review doc).
--                  Slots 054 already keys (its fold-in of the verified rows' measures) are skipped, never duplicated.
